backend/build
backend/.env*
backend/.gradle
# Both patterns are root-anchored — Docker's matcher is NOT recursive, so these exclude the
# repo-root docs/ and top-level *.md only. The RAG corpus at
# backend/src/main/resources/docs/*.md must keep shipping: writing these as **/docs or **/*.md
# would silently deploy an image with an empty strategy library.
docs
*.md
